--- !u!114 &6309686236112926677
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4758262141560354267}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b76c5b6d2602a453c853467a4e93dbb9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Merchant
  npcName: Barnaby
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b49d6198dbcbf433e81b4134c9901cbb, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6843b98dc1d38430092c997e23b5bf09, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Barnaby
    sets: met:Barnaby
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Well, hello there! Welcome to Hollyhock! I'm Barnaby Badger, and this is my little stall.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: What are you selling?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Only the finest bubble bath in the whole kingdom! Lavender and honey. One bottle makes a mountain of bubbles.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: What does it do?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Pour a bottle into a warm bath and you'll see! Bubbles up to your nose! Ten coins a bottle, whenever you like, {hero}.
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: -1}
  flipbook: {fileID: 9007086452824870593}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: -920907343, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -771842892, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1002978737, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1218817151, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: -1117297508, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -191947518, guid: a239fb551b18e4d288879f253fca4a46, type: 3}
  idleFps: 3
  talkFps: 8
  ware: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6b9f0a6ee2a9b4b53b297fc6a3490040, type: 2}
  price: 10
  thanks: A splendid choice! Lavender and honey, with a bow on top. Enjoy, {hero}! | Another one? You must be the cleanest hero in the land! | Bubbles for everybody! Thank you kindly, {hero}. | Ho ho! At this rate you'll need a bigger bathtub!
  tooPoor: Ah, that's {price} coins, I'm afraid. Monsters drop lots of coins. Come back when your purse jingles!
  bagFull: Goodness, your bag is full to bursting! Make a little room and come back.
  saleSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9f2232dc1a084e389e6c2fa8eabb14d, type: 3}
  altWare: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d745c400146514c0489e992d3e532437, type: 2}
  altPrice: 12
  altCondition: met:Mr. Frost,!has:ball_of_yarn,!purl:knit
  altThanks: A ball of my best red wool! Granny Purl will knit wonders with that. Give her my regards!
